historical_release_gate_performance_anchor: "Preserve the 6,381,891.9148 ms complete generated-byte publication test and 7,853,326.4993 ms shard-8 duration as the immutable pre-optimization correctness baseline. Preserve the 151,129.3815 ms pass as pre-generation-only-correction development evidence and the corrected dirty-tree 168,988.6254 ms pass as local development evidence. The exact clean committed target now passes in 165,509.3389 ms, and the clean 10-shard gate passes 23/23 without weakening graph, readback, redaction, authority, append-only, source-integrity, or the fixed 180,000 ms target ceiling. Continue with the complete SLM2-only browser/package/converter replacement and deletion of every active SLM1 path; add no compatibility or temporary dual implementation."
