prompt2_format_history_anchor: "Preserve prior Prompt2 profile `b317ae0207522399e63125c57daf91d97432f95b26bd8fb71db746934ff05c8c`, vectors `9d3354785614ff60edc679b6fea6797164ffac368edaa9d3d50912b525048cc0`, artifact `d3a123f327e7c4c3eb53d642c4b8d98c39a0b30bac2cc1970922612ae502f142`, and Node source `e993bde73b69422197e50b968869f19cfd9093cfc3aec4472205a67d47efdedd` only as the registered pre-rebind input snapshot. Preserve its render-once, tokenize-once, recompose-and-compare, insertion, context, and Sampling2 semantics in the replacement, but do not retain or accept its stale dense-F32 SLM2 dependency identity as an executable profile or fallback."
