sampling2_format_anchor: "Use sole clean-slate `org.minimodel.sampling2/2.0` from remote-exact commit `78aeb8d0f95f95330f97a572c5ef02b8d2b41fd5`. Preserve profile SHA256 `ec65e8f1a54c1e4ca95ebda88bde091dad11337250e541bbda60e8cac311428d`, normative Q48 table `fce2345bd4ddc53f137ecc36a48afca02a73ebd3549acce942628e440429c677`, vectors `4fe731f2e8714e9a6fe7689964a88a7fbe8150faf6af053cbf0be38390daaa9f`, canonical artifact `9e02fcfbba169330a2ee1bf40cea015dc4067925e051f6ae5f197a5f880bfe89`, and independent Node source `bd7b4ed8cf1bdaef10f8b2041df476f842b08e0d65325d0b0e439cd0b8697b7b`. Exact integer score/filter/PRNG/selection/state/terminal semantics, no defaults or repair, and Template2 ownership of ordered stop IDs are architectural invariants."
