historical_registration_replay_anchor: "Replay immutable evidence from the exact Git registration tree: require one canonical profile addition commit, its exact checked-in profile blob, and its declared sole parent before materializing registered files. Tokenizer2 v1, v2, and browser registrations resolve to dc0f5f783de54b8c556064bc1d8a6b21d9cdb9a9, 6e653482bc551d17f50ab2cf676236bceb139e42, and 4461ee0c3c09f42ae44bf1eb9dd0d76ffe0bc8dc. Preserve frozen bytes and full hostile/semantic coverage while allowing unrelated clean-slate descendants to evolve."
