qwen_tokenizer2_browser_wasm_verification_anchor: "Preserve the completed registration and never rerun it. Implementation `4461ee0c3c09f42ae44bf1eb9dd0d76ffe0bc8dc` and observation source `f4c6cabd05977b07fc8a6a441ec0550ba233bc2f` were pushed and fresh-remote exact before output. Execution profile SHA256 is `8734360e7fc2e0d4cb4f6ace87e2b5ec2922f983eededa7f5b246fad928050f3`; verification profile SHA256 is `560347bb1db2f1299bc3f54d5e2a8a5d6adbb26e1a55b908c4bb754d72f540a2`. One runner invocation produced two raw runs at SHA256 `0ed18293784438035b06d99e8709c382ccef1a775c70f00d624a3964d3c92905` and `fb493d2e251c8efa6e12d73664aa319ad4901235fa46edf5b00fc4b43806e920`; one verifier invocation accepted all 2,048 cases, 69,294 tokens, exact IDs and decodes, repeatability, worker termination/recovery, zero network/errors, closure/deletion, and resource bounds with zero mismatches. Public-safe result is 3,909 bytes at SHA256 `f828190b2ff5d3c1e794cb50f3b0dd8c41367ed09fca758eeb513fb1ec2c964e`. This authorizes clean-slate Template2 work only; it grants no model, quality, release, deployment, or campaign claim."
